                "value": "Embryonic zygotic expression is seen in invaginating presumptive mesoderm and ectodermally derived tissues during gastrulation. At stage 8, expression is also seen in anterior and posterior midgut and cephalic furrow. By stage 9, expression is highest in visceral mesoderm of anterior and posterior midgut, ventral nerve cord and somatic mesoderm"
